The dictionary deduplication in src/common/pattern_dictionary.hpp and the
3D block bit layout in src/map3d/map_converter.cpp are adapted from
src/core/PatternDictionaryBuilder.cpp and src/model/VoxelGrid.cpp.
The HDF5 primitives in src/common/hdf5.hpp and the 3D packing convention
in src/map3d/map_io.cpp are adapted from src/io/HDF5IO.cpp.
The adapted files identify changes. The shared primitives also support
the independently implemented 2D map format.

Reference papers:
Ryo Funai, Yasuo Hayashibara, Ryuichi Ueda,
"Compression of Occupancy Grid Maps by Vector Quantization and
Localization Using Maps in Compressed Form", 43rd Annual Conference
of the Robotics Society of Japan, 2025, RSJ2025AC3Q3-08.
(English rendering of the Japanese title.)

Ryo Funai, Yasuo Hayashibara, Ryuichi Ueda,
"Compression of 3D Occupancy Grid Map for Mobile Robot Localization
using Vector Quantization", 31st Robotics Symposia, 2026, pp. 15-21.

emcl3d informed the package layout. No emcl3d source is included.
